flickos-media (1.7) trixie; urgency=medium

  * A Flatpak player (Flathub's Spotify) no longer counts as silent 5 s
    into every song: its D-Bus name belongs to its xdg-dbus-proxy, so
    every process of its Flatpak instance now stands for it when its
    sound is looked for.

