flickos-media (1.6) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Rainbow colors for the sound spectrum, by choice: spectrum-colors
    style|rainbow (style by default). Round the ring from cyan at the
    top to red at the bottom with a white ring, or along the strip from
    the left; drawn once per size, so no dearer than the style's color.
    A change redraws a running spectrum without restarting it.

 -- Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:43:00 +0800

flickos-media (1.5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Media controls only while something plays or is paused: a stopped
    player isn't shown, and one that says it plays but has had no audio
    stream in PipeWire for 5 seconds counts as stopped (Firefox kept
    saying Playing for a video Discord took off the page). pw-dump runs
    only while a player says it plays; Depends pipewire-bin.
  * The follower says why it ended in the panel's log, and reads
    playerctl's lines without keeping one back in a buffer.

